{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XbgAWiwp5CHk1PRx6TiXqq","type":"tool_result","content":"wrote ../../mocap/ef-clips.js: 31 clips from QUATERNIUS and MESH2MOTION and CMU and CMU_10 and CMU_11, 986 key poses, 298 KB\ntotal 308\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 07:20 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 07:20 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 305459 Nov  4 07:20 ef-clips.js\n/* EF: an animation set in my-3D2dge's readable format (written by the tools in tools/; clips may be edited by hand).\n * Quaternius Universal Animation Library 1 and 2 (CC0); Mesh2Motion (CC0); CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\n * 31 clips, 986 key poses. Played by src/mocap/mocap.js with src/mocap/readable.js. \"sources\" holds the proportions\n * each library was measured with; \"fit\" each clip's average and worst body-point error against its capture (mm).\n * my-3D2dge readable clip. Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.\n * L and R are the figure's own sides. Directions are percentages and need not add up: [100, 0, 0] and [50, 0, 0] agree.\n * hips   [forward, right, up]   the pelvis, in percent of standing hip height (100 = standing, 55 = sitting on a chair)\n * body   [turn, lean, tilt]     the pelvis, degrees: turn + = toward the right, lean + = forward, tilt + = toward the right\n * chest  [turn, lean, tilt]     the chest, relative to the pelvis        head [turn, lean, tilt]  relative to the chest\n * shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n * armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n *            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n *","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"452d6482-9020-4e99-982f-14f7a7dcf527","uuid":"bcf4465e-191f-41ca-aee6-3f8fa4ea15c2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:20:16.675Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"wrote ../../mocap/ef-clips.js: 31 clips from QUATERNIUS and MESH2MOTION and CMU and CMU_10 and CMU_11, 986 key poses, 298 KB\ntotal 308\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 07:20 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 07:20 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 305459 Nov  4 07:20 ef-clips.js\n/* EF: an animation set in my-3D2dge's readable format (written by the tools in tools/; clips may be edited by hand).\n * Quaternius Universal Animation Library 1 and 2 (CC0); Mesh2Motion (CC0); CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), free for all uses; created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.\n * 31 clips, 986 key poses. Played by src/mocap/mocap.js with src/mocap/readable.js. \"sources\" holds the proportions\n * each library was measured with; \"fit\" each clip's average and worst body-point error against its capture (mm).\n * my-3D2dge readable clip. Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.\n * L and R are the figure's own sides. Directions are percentages and need not add up: [100, 0, 0] and [50, 0, 0] agree.\n * hips   [forward, right, up]   the pelvis, in percent of standing hip height (100 = standing, 55 = sitting on a chair)\n * body   [turn, lean, tilt]     the pelvis, degrees: turn + = toward the right, lean + = forward, tilt + = toward the right\n * chest  [turn, lean, tilt]     the chest, relative to the pelvis        head [turn, lean, tilt]  relative to the chest\n * shL shR    [reach, shrug]     degrees the shoulder swings forward (into a punch or an aim) and up, from rest\n * armL armR  [forward, out, up, bend, twist]  which way the arm points from the shoulder to the fist, in chest space\n *            (out + = away from the body on that side; [0, 0, -100] hangs down, [100, 0, 0] punches ahead);\n *","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOu