creamer/aftertouch, air moves, 5 skills, poke/slide/barge, knock/launch, theatrics), keepers, team AI","-  (formations, pressing, marking, utility carrier, gimmicks), rules (clock, stoppage, halves, golden goal ET,","-  shootout), set pieces (kickoff, goal kick, corner ring, free kick wall/reticle, penalty, crowd throwback,","-  PenaltyKick), referee (fouls, advantage, cards, dive judging, VAR), Euphoria/Europhoria/super/Save Duel/bus/Golden","-  Moment/celebrations, matchday events.","-- Data: 50-teams (6 teams, formations, tactics, refs, supers, celebrations), 51-stadiums (5 + rec).","-- tools/scratch/sim1.mjs: AI-vs-AI smoke (all tactics) runs clean.","+- Build: `node tools/build.mjs` -> `build/game.js`, the dev page `build/index.html`, and the deliverable","+  `../EurophoriaFootball-EuropeanFootball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-071739.html` (everything inlined; runs from","+  `file://`). The About pages are generated from `../exit-interview.json`.","+- Test: `node tools/test.mjs [suite ...]` prints only failures and one count line. Suites: unit rules euphoria ai","+  content ui saves attract dev training determinism lint playthrough hubsim sweep browser hub. Add `--report` for the","+  balance soak's numbers and the harness checklists; `--soak` runs 20 matches a pairing.","+- Screenshots: `node tools/shot.mjs out.png \"#deep/link\" wait:ms eval:js key:Code shot:path`; `node tools/grid.mjs`","+  makes a contact sheet; `tools/check.mjs` and `tools/filmstrip.mjs` are the engine's."," ","-- Presentation: 02-glyphs, 03-audio (SFX, 15 songs, crowd engine, chants, babble), 21-camera, 22-replay, 23-commentary","-  (+53-lines ~330), 24-hud, 25-view, 26-crowd, 27-cast. UI: 30-ui kit, 31-front (title, setup, side picker, results,","-  album, about), 32-cup (bracket, beats, tunnel/card, ending), 33-match scene (+MatchAudio), 34-training (+54-drills),","-  43-saves, 52-story, 55-chants, 90-start. tools/shot.mjs takes screenshots.","-## Next (old list below)","-- Presentation: 21-camera, 22-replay, 23-commentary (+53 lines), 24-hud, 25-view (pitch/stands/crowd/goals/rigs/fx),","-  03-audio (+55 songs), 02-glyphs.","-- UI: 30-ui kit, 31-front scenes, 32-cup (+52 story), 33-match scene, 34-training (+54 drills), 40-attract, 41-dev,","-  42-hub, 43-saves, 90-start.","-- tools/test.mjs suites; exit-interview.json; About pages.","+## Layout","+- `engine/my-3d2dge.js`: my-3D2dge v0.85.2 with five changes (`// EF:`), see `engine/CHANGES-ENGINE.md`;","+  `tools/patches/*.mjs` re-apply them to a fresh engine.","+- `vendor/session.js` (AI Hub client 1.4.0, unmodified), `vendor/mocap/` (the engine repo's mocap player),","+  `mocap/ef-clips.js` (31 clips cut with the engine's anim-set tool).","+- `src/NN-*.js`: the game, one IIFE. 00 core, 01 input, 02 glyphs, 03 audio, 04 art, 05 anim, 10-20 the match","+  simulation (match, pitch, ball, footballer, keeper, team AI, rules, set pieces, referee, Euphoria, events), 21-27","+  presentation (camera, replay, commentary, HUD, view, crowd, cast), 30-34 UI and scenes (UI kit, front end, cup,","+  match, training), 40 attract, 41 dev mode and deep links, 42 AI Hub, 43 saves, 50-55 content (teams, stadiums,","+  story, lines, drills, chants), 90 start.","+- `tools/harness/`: the AI Hub harness (harness.html, bridge.js, round.js) for the `hub` suite.","+","+## State","+Feature-complete per TASK.md and PLAN.md: Cup Run (prologue, five rounds, team talks, challenges, villain, ending","+with ceremony, parade and credits, CONTINUE?), Kick-About (6 teams, 5 stadiums, conditions, 1-4 local players),","+Penalties, Training (9 drills), Sticker Album (51), About & Credits, attract mode, dev mode, AI Hub sessions.","+All suites pass."]}],"originalFile":"# Europhoria Football: build progress\n\nWork root: `..` (TASK.md, PLAN.md). Dev folder: this one. Build: `node tools/build.mjs`. Deliverable:\n`../EurophoriaFootball-EuropeanFootball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-071739.html`.\n\n## Done\n- Setup: engine copied (engine/my-3d2dge.js, patched via tools/patches/*.mjs: dialog voice fn, audio buses, kit patterns +\n  numbers, body tilt, accented font), vendor/session.js 1.4.0, vendor/mocap, mocap/ef-clips.js (31 clips; names have\n  no set prefix), tools/build.mjs, tools/lib/load.mjs (vm loader).\n- Sim (src/10-20): Match core, pitch/TileMap, ball (+7 super paths, nets), footballer (pass/through/lob/cross/chip,\n  shot meter/screamer/aftertouch, air moves, 5 skills, poke/slide/barge, knock/launch, theatrics), keepers, team AI\n  (formations, pressing, marking, utility carrier, gimmicks), rules (clock, stoppage, halves, golden goal ET,\n  shootout), set pieces (kickoff, goal kick, corner ring, free kick wall/reticle, penalty, crowd throwback,\n  PenaltyKick), referee (fouls, advantage, cards, dive judging, VAR), Euphoria/Europhoria/super/Save Duel/bus/Golden\n  Moment/celebrations, matchday events.\n- Data: 50-teams (6 teams, formations, tactics, refs, supers, celebrations), 51-stadiums (5 + rec).\n- tools/scratch/sim1.mjs: AI-vs-AI smoke (all tactics) runs clean.\n\n- Presentation: 02-glyphs, 03-audio (SFX, 15 songs, crowd engine, chants, babble), 21-camera, 22-replay, 23-commentary\n  (+53-lines ~330), 24-hud, 25-view, 26-crowd, 27-cast. UI: 30-ui kit, 31-front (title, setup, side picker, results,\n  album, about), 32-cup (bracket, beats, tunnel/card, ending), 33-match scene (+MatchAudio), 34-training (+54-drills),\n  43-saves, 52-story, 55-chants, 90-start. tools/shot.mjs takes screenshots.\n## Next (old list below)\n- Presentation: 21-camera, 22-replay, 23-commentary (+53 lines), 24-hud, 25-view (pitch/stands/crowd/goals/rigs/fx),\n  03-audio (+55 songs), 02-glyphs.\n- UI: 30-ui kit, 31-front scenes, 32-cup (+52 story), 33-match scene, 34-training (+54 drills), 40-attract, 41-dev,\n  42-hub, 43-saves, 90-start.\n- tools/test.mjs suites; exit-interview.json; About pages.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MNtfUb5UhKAg8ug89aAgEs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
