{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiBdJeZYCYWrSHmiVNWt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TLxBEWSH98HowXRPX5hiNP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-071739__xcf3323/work; date '+%H:%M'; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='exit-interview.json'; j=json.load(open(p))\nsi=j['sourceInformation']\nsi['testing']=\"One command, node tools/test.mjs, 17 suites printing only failures and a count: unit physics, rules, Euphoria and super strikes, AI with a balance soak, content, UI by pad, keyboard, mouse and touch-only, saves, attract mode, dev mode, all nine training drills, determinism, lint, a full scripted playthrough of the cup and every mode, a fake-hub loopback with latency, jitter and loss, a browser sweep that draws every scene and moment, browser checks with the engine's checker at three screen sizes, and the real AI Hub harness in four scenarios (391 checks, all passing); screenshots only for looks\"\nsi['usage']=\"Session time about 2 hours 10 minutes (07:17 to about 09:27); token count and API cost unknown (no usage meter was available to this session)\"\nj['testingFeedback'][0]=\"About 34: 24 in the game and 10 in the tests themselves. The game's: players frozen on their set-piece spots after every restart, keepers who never saved corner-bound shots, a crash when red cards left a side with no outfield players, three crashes at load or on entering a scene (a registry used before it existed, front-end scenes losing their own methods, story data read before it was defined), two training drills that crashed looking up a hidden keeper, a draw-time crash in the attract mode's scripted Save Duel, humans auto-switched onto their own goalkeeper, passes that under-led moving receivers, a team with no captain, two short commentary pools, Math.random in the simulation, two syntax errors in commentary text, and screen problems (the PA box over the score and the notices, set-piece prompts and the replay tag under the commentary, the logo over the menu, unknown glyphs, a washed-out snow pitch, the results over the LED boards).\"\nj['testingFeedback'][1]=\"8 were critical: the frozen players, the red-card crash, the three load and scene crashes, the two broken training drills (counted as one), and the two syntax errors that would have stopped the game from loading at all.\"\nj['testingFeedback'][3]=\"Still screenshots of the super strike: timing a browser screenshot from outside the page to a 0.6-second slow-motion charge-up gave confusing frames, while the headless test that every super path reaches the goal answered the real question. (The opposite lesson: headless tests skip drawing, so the browser sweep that draws every moment was worth adding late; it caught the attract mode's draw-time crash.)\"\njson.dump(j, open(p,'w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\njson.load(open(p)); print('ok')\nEOF\ncd EurophoriaFootball-EuropeanFootball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-071739 && node tools/build.mjs | tail -1","description":"Finalise the exit interview and rebuild"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1460,"cache_read_input_tokens":896282,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1460},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"452d6482-9020-4e99-982f-14f7a7dcf527","uuid":"3d5fe7bd-1a84-4afd-9396-279c2c29e221","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:13:50.716Z","request_id":"req_011CgiBdJ84884Ujv6HgZXuy","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TLxBEWSH98HowXRPX5hiNP":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-071739__xcf3323/work; date '+%H:%M'; python3 - <<'EOF'\ni