{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiG63auaXkdQChibbMdb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The run you asked about (btklcjbyq) finished at 525 passed, 1 failed. The failure was a flaky Save Duel test. That test jumps straight to a duel without fixing the random seed, and sometimes a defender tackled the CPU shooter before he could strike. I fixed both sides of it:\n- The dev trigger now clears defenders near the shooter, so the duel and super strike moments always happen.\n- The test now pins its seed. It passed five times in a row after the change.\n\nBecause that fix changed the game file, I've started a fresh full run on the final build (b7tibypxq). It began around 10:08 and takes about 15 minutes. The hand-back waits on its result."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":296,"cache_read_input_tokens":944883,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":296},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"452d6482-9020-4e99-982f-14f7a7dcf527","uuid":"19255dfa-e9c8-4a5b-977d-4416eb9f8e14","timestamp":"2026-11-04T17:12:10.232Z","request_id":"req_011CgiG639rncEncwqLqYhRT"}
