{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiJDLdXAj3fMxe7uMagp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite is running on the final build. While writing the line-by-line TASK.md check I found and fixed two real problems:\n\n- **Mocap clips never loaded.** The game looked for `window.Mocap`, but the mocap player is declared as a top-level `const`, so all 31 clips were skipped and the game quietly used its procedural poses instead. It now loads the set. Screenshots in the browser show the slide, get-up, keeper throw, referee gestures, backflip and knee slide playing their clips, with no page errors. I also added a `content` check that the set loads and contains every clip name the game uses.\n- **Leaving the attract demo could take about 0.7 s.** If a slow-motion moment was playing, it stretched the 0.22 s fade. Slow motion is now cut the moment any input arrives.\n\nThe new `task` suite passed 34 of 34 on its last run. Running the full suite again is what's left: the 561 count in `exit-interview.json` is my estimate and gets corrected if the run disagrees. The final reply with the four sections comes after that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":420,"cache_read_input_tokens":138049,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":420},"output_tokens":345,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"452d6482-9020-4e99-982f-14f7a7dcf527","uuid":"783a7bbf-e153-4faa-a83f-5b0f5bce470b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T17:40:02.454Z","request_id":"req_011CgiJDLNPHJk1ZmXTD3B3i"}
